1
00:00:00,512 --> 00:00:04,142
(Raj:)Stuart, is the Wil Wheaton signed up
for the Mystic Warlords Tournament...

2
00:00:04,307 --> 00:00:06,097
(Raj:)...the Wil Wheaton from Star Trek?

3
00:00:06,267 --> 00:00:08,357
(Stuart:)Yeah, he lives around here. Big gamer.

4
00:00:08,520 --> 00:00:11,520
(Howard(phone rings):)Excuse me,
are you saying that Wil Wheaton...

5
00:00:11,689 --> 00:00:15,319
...a.k.a. Ensign Wesley Crusher
on Star Trek: The Next Generation...

6
00:00:15,485 --> 00:00:17,445
...is participating in your tournament?

7
00:00:17,612 --> 00:00:21,742
(Stuart:)I'm sorry, did I rob you of the opportunity
to stumble onto that for yourself?

8
00:00:22,617 --> 00:00:26,537
No, wait, you don't understand.
Growing up, I idolized Wil Wheaton.

9
00:00:26,704 --> 00:00:29,914
You know, Wesley Crusher
had an eidetic memory just like me.

10
00:00:30,083 --> 00:00:32,753
(Raj:)Oh, what a coincidence.
You can discuss that with him...

11
00:00:32,919 --> 00:00:35,089
...while playing in the tournament.
Sign here.

12
00:00:35,255 --> 00:00:39,215
Yeah, I was such a fan that in 1995
I traveled 10 hours by bus...

13
00:00:39,384 --> 00:00:41,884
(Sheldon:)...to a sci-fi convention
in Jackson, Mississippi...

14
00:00:42,053 --> 00:00:44,473
...wearing my Starfleet Academy
cadet uniform...

15
00:00:44,639 --> 00:00:47,309
(Sheldon:)...in order to meet Wil Wheaton
and get him to autograph...

16
00:00:47,475 --> 00:00:50,145
...my mint-in-package
Wesley Crusher action figure.

17
00:00:51,145 --> 00:00:53,605
(Raj:)Oh, it'll be like a reunion then.
Sign here.

18
00:00:53,773 --> 00:00:56,693
Yeah, my arduous journey, however,
was for naught.

